  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco Mechanics Gloves are designed to provide exceptional protection and grip for a variety of activities. The gloves feature padded synthetic leather palms and fingers that absorb impact and offer additional protection from abrasions. Enhanced gel grip padding on the palms ensures superior handling and control, making these gloves ideal for any task requiring a firm grip. Crafted from moisture wicking poly/spandex knit fabric, these gloves keep your hands cool, dry, and comfortable, even during intense activities.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
